#30000
The Hall of Judgement~
   You step forth from beyond the veil and into a small part of Limbo.  You are
neither dead nor alive, and your presence here means you must go forth into the
Realms and leave this place of stasis.  A ghostly being, a herald of some sort,
urges you north through a set of black, wrought-iron gates.  A voice speaks to
your mind telling you to use the @Ynewbie@n command if you need help at any
time.  If you are completely new to muds, please go east by typing @Yeast@n to
begin the beginner's lessons.  If you have already created your character,
please go @Ywest@n.
