#30001
Choose Your Race~
@W========================================@n
@C        STEP 1: CHOOSE YOUR RACE      @n
@W========================================@n

Pharasma's servants guide you to select your race for life on Golarion.

@W=== COMMANDS ===@n
• @Ylistraces@n        - View available races and bonuses
• @Ysetrace <name>@n   - Select your race
• @Yhelp race <name>@n - Detailed racial information
• @Yhelp races@n       - Full list of all races

@W=== EXAMPLES ===@n
• @Ysetrace human@n    - Choose human race
• @Ysetrace elf@n      - Choose elf race
• @Ysetrace dwarf@n    - Choose dwarf race

@W=== ABOUT RACES ===@n
Each race offers unique ability score modifiers, special abilities,
and cultural flavor. Common races are available to all players, while
advanced races may require account experience to unlock.

@GTip: Humans get +2 skill points at level 1 and +1 per level after@n
@GTip: Your race choice affects stats, size, and special abilities@n

Go @Ynorth@n when ready to continue.
