#30003
Choose Your Ability Scores~
@W========================================@n
@C     STEP 3: ASSIGN ABILITY SCORES    @n
@W========================================@n

You have @Y20 stat points@n to spend (24 if human, 22 if half-elf).

@W=== COMMANDS ===@n
• @Ysetstats <ability> <value>@n - Set a score
• @Ysetstats show@n             - View current scores
• @Ysetstats reset@n            - Start over

@W=== POINT BUY COSTS ===@n
Score | Cost  |  Score | Cost
------+-------+--------+------
  8   |  0    |   14   |  6
  9   |  1    |   15   |  8
 10   |  2    |   16   | 10
 11   |  3    |   17   | 13
 12   |  4    |   18   | 16
 13   |  5    |

@W=== ABILITIES ===@n
• @YStrength@n     - Physical power (melee damage, carrying capacity)
• @YDexterity@n    - Agility and reflexes (AC, ranged attacks, initiative)
• @YConstitution@n - Health and endurance (hit points)
• @YIntelligence@n - Reasoning and memory (skill points, wizard spells)
• @YWisdom@n       - Awareness and insight (will saves, cleric spells)
• @YCharisma@n     - Force of personality (social skills, sorcerer spells)

@GTip: Type 'help ability score <name>' for detailed information@n
@GTip: No stat can be set below 8 or above 18@n

Go @Ynorth@n when ready to continue.
