#30004
Choose Your Description~
@W========================================@n
@C       STEP 4: DESCRIBE YOURSELF     @n
@W========================================@n

Pharasma's servants guide you to describe your physical appearance.

@W=== COMMAND ===@n
• @Ysetdescs@n - Enter the description creation menu

@W=== HOW IT WORKS ===@n
You'll create a short description by selecting physical features:
  • Choose a feature type (eyes, hair, build, etc.)
  • Select an adjective to describe it
  • Optionally add a second descriptor

@W=== EXAMPLES ===@n
  • "a male human with blue eyes"
  • "a female elf with long silver hair"
  • "a stocky dwarf with a scarred face"

@W=== IMPORTANT ===@n
This short description is temporary. You'll need to write custom
descriptions later to advance beyond level 10 (usually 15-30 hours
of gameplay). These require staff approval.

@GTip: Keep descriptions concise - they replace your name@n
@GTip: If you don't see a descriptor you want, ask a God to add it@n

