#30020
Levelling Up~
@W========================================@n
@C     STEP 6: GAIN YOUR FIRST LEVEL   @n
@W========================================@n

Time to level up and choose your class!

@W=== THE LEVELUP COMMAND ===@n
Every time you gain enough experience, use @Ylevelup@n to advance.

The levelup menu will guide you through:
  1. @YClass Selection@n - Choose which class to take
  2. @YSkill Allocation@n - Spend skill points
  3. @YFeat Selection@n - Choose feats (if available)
  4. @YAbility Increases@n - Improve stats (every 4 levels)
  5. @YReview & Confirm@n - See changes before finalizing

@W=== YOUR FIRST LEVEL ===@n
You'll select:
  • Your @Ystarting class@n (Wizard, Cleric, Fighter, etc.)
  • @YTwo traits@n (permanent background bonuses)
  • Your @Ystarting skills@n
  • Your @Yfirst feat@n

@GTip: Take your time - some choices are permanent!@n
@GTip: Type 'help classes' to learn about class options@n

Type @Ylevelup@n now to begin!
