#30025
Reviewing Your Spell List~
   Before you go around laying waste to the landscape with your obviously
impressive magical prowess, you'll want to see first what @Yspells@n you can
actually cast.  If you're a wizard, the spells you can cast are in your
spellbooks, which have to be memorized first.  To read about spellbooks go west
and to read about memorization, go east.  Other classes have an innate list of
spells available to them.  To view the spells you can cast simply type
@Yspells@n.  If you have more than one spellcasting class, then type @Yspells <class
name>@n, for example spells cleric.  If you wish to view only a single spell level
for a class type @Yspells <class name> <spell level>@n.  For example 'spells
sorcerer 3' will list all level 3 sorcerer spells available to me.  
~
