#30027
Combat Basics~
Our combat system is pulse based and is pretty simple, if you are used to most
Diku-style MUDs.  @YAUTO-ATTACK is set as a default, and is not beneficial to
spellcasters.  Use the autoattack command to turn it off.  @n The most important
thing to know about combat here is how to target effectively, and this concept
goes beyond simple combat.  Often you will find multiple creatures with similar
keywords.  There are two ways to differentiate between them.  The first is to
proceed the keyword list with a they were loaded into the game), I would type 2.
Guard.  The same is applied to commands that affect anywhere on the mud.  The
second way is to use multiple track down a troll guard, I would type
troll,guard.  Notice that the keywords are separated by a comma.  If there was a
burly troll guard and a skinny troll guard and I wanted the skinny one, I would
type track skinny,troll,guard.  If I wanted to track the 2nd skinny troll guard
on the mud, I would type track 2.  Skinny,troll,guard - keywords.  
~
