#30032
Religion, Devotion and Domains~
@W========================================@n
@C    RELIGION, DEVOTION, AND DOMAINS   @n
@W========================================@n

In Golarion, religion is a fundamental part of life and death.

@W=== WHY DEVOTION MATTERS ===@n
• Pharasma judges @Yall souls@n in the afterlife
• Those who worship no deity face @Rdire consequences@n
• @YDivine spellcasters@n (Clerics, Paladins) @Ycannot cast@n without a patron
• Death penalties are @Rheavier@n without devotion

@W=== COMMANDS ===@n
• @Ydevote list@n           - See available deities
• @Ydevote info <deity>@n   - Learn about a specific deity
• @Ydevote <deity name>@n   - Devote yourself to a deity
• @Ydomain@n                - View your deity's domains (Clerics)
• @Yhelp domain <name>@n    - Learn about a specific domain

@W=== EXAMPLES ===@n
• @Ydevote Sarenrae@n   - Devote to the goddess of healing and sun
• @Ydevote Abadar@n     - Devote to the god of cities and law
• @Ydevote Desna@n      - Devote to the goddess of luck and travel

@W=== FOR CLERICS ONLY ===@n
Clerics gain access to @Yall domains@n their deity offers.
Each domain provides:
  • @YBonus domain spells@n automatically known
  • @YSpecial domain powers@n unique to that domain

Type @Yhelp domain <name>@n to see benefits of each domain.

@RIMPORTANT: Devotion is required! Choose carefully.@n

Go @Ynorth@n when ready to continue.
~
