#30033
Before You Enter the Game~
@W========================================@n
@C    CONGRATULATIONS! YOU'RE READY!    @n
@W========================================@n

Your character is complete! Time to enter the world of Golarion.

@W=== NEXT STEPS ===@n
• Type @Ystat@n to see your character sheet anytime
• Go @Ywest@n to enter the game
• Use @Yrecall@n anytime to return to this area

@W=== HELPFUL COMMANDS ===@n
• @Yhelp newbie@n       - Essential newbie guide
• @Yhelp newbie zones@n - Beginner-friendly areas
• @Ynewbie@n            - Ask for help from experienced players
• @Ypetition@n          - Contact staff if you need assistance

@W=== IMPORTANT REMINDERS ===@n
• Complete the @Ymain quest line@n started by the old lady in Palanthas
• Join a @Ygroup@n for safer adventuring
• @YRead help files@n when you're unsure about commands
• @YAsk questions@n - the community is helpful!

@W=== SURVIVAL TIPS ===@n
• Type @Yconsider <target>@n before attacking
• Save money for important purchases
• Don't venture too far alone at low levels
• Death has consequences - be careful!

@GYou're about to begin an epic adventure. Good luck!@n

Go @Ywest@n to enter Golarion!
