#30034
Choose Your Equipment~
@W========================================@n
@C       CHOOSE YOUR EQUIPMENT          @n
@W========================================@n

Equip yourself for adventure! You can purchase starting gear here.

@W=== COMMANDS ===@n
• @Ylist weapons <type>@n  - View available weapons
• @Ylist armor <type>@n    - View available armor
• @Ybuy <item name>@n      - Purchase an item

@W=== WEAPON TYPES ===@n
• @Ysimple@n   - Basic weapons (clubs, daggers, etc.)
• @Ymartial@n  - Advanced weapons (swords, axes, etc.)
• @Yexotic@n   - Specialized weapons (requires feat)

@W=== ARMOR TYPES ===@n
• @Ylight@n   - Leather, padded (low AC, no spell penalty)
• @Ymedium@n  - Chain shirt, scale mail (moderate AC)
• @Yheavy@n   - Full plate, splint mail (high AC, spell penalty)
• @Yshields@n - Bucklers, shields, tower shields

@W=== EXAMPLES ===@n
• @Ylist weapons simple@n
• @Ylist armor light@n
• @Ybuy longsword@n
• @Ybuy leather armor@n

@GTip: Your starting gold depends on your class@n
@GTip: Spellcasters should avoid heavy armor (spell failure!)@n

Go @Ynorth@n when ready to enter the game.
